A||N||9||AusFiero||My faith in retailers and people in general restored. ||||1||
Z||000000||AusFiero||07-23-2001||04:18 AM||||  Well this doesn't happen often. But 18 months ago I bought a digital video camera that was supposed to give high quality digital stills as well. Well over time I have never got the quality and the camera died anyway.<BR>  So I contacted the manufacturer who told me the camera was never capapble of doing what the salesman told me even though I had spent $3000 on it.<BR>  So back to the store I go and see the manager for a meeting this afternoon expecting no outcome of course.<BR>  But after 1 hour of discussions and salesman getting called in and finding he knows sh1t about the cameras anyway but still sold it to me telling me everything i wanted to hear basically so ghe could get his comission, the store has agreed to replace the Camera with not 1, but 2 cameras. A new model digital stills camera worth $1500 and so I still have video also a basic model normal non digital video camera worth $900.<BR>  OK I lose $600 of my original investment but 18 months ago I could not buy the same quality equipment for that much money so I figure I am in front anyway.<BR>  Kinda rstores the faith in human nature and retailers who coulda just said get out.<P><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/ausfiero1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A> | <A HREF="http://www.auto-alley.com" TARGET=_blank>Fiero Accessories</A>||202.139.20.3||reg||1
Z||000001||DecadenceR||07-23-2001||11:33 AM||||It's nice to know that there really are a few people out there that will help you out. Doesn't happn often, but it makes you feel good when it actually does.||||reg||1
