Z||000008||AusFiero||07-24-2001||01:04 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Robert:<BR><B>Hey Aus; did you notice the rebate offer?<BR> <A HREF="http://www.kodak.com.au/US/en/digital/promos/dc4800Rebate/;$sessionid$23521ZQAAC3G3QHIO2SHWGA" TARGET=_blank>http://www.kodak.com.au/US/en/digital/promos/dc4800Rebate/;$sessionid$23521ZQAAC3 G3QHIO2SHWGA</A> </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Hey thanks Rob no I hadn't... I have now and I have receipts as a new purchase  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>Oh they also threw in 2 spare batteries for the video camera giving me 7.5 hours of record time. <BR>The original camera I purchased was a  Panasonic NV DS33. <BR>||||reg||1
